The purpose of this directory is to test AI models to gain benchmarks to later compare with other models.

Install the optional local embedding evaluator before running the benchmark:

```bash
uv sync --extra benchmark
```

The benchmark uses `sentence-transformers/all-mpnet-base-v2` by default for
target-conditioned semantic alignment. Override it by passing
`embedding_model_name` to `benchmark_model`. The model weights are downloaded
on first use and can be reused offline from the local Hugging Face cache.

Existing result files are resumed. Missing MCTD, semantic-alignment, and
structured-judge metrics are backfilled without regenerating model outputs.
Each judge result is checkpointed immediately so interrupted runs can resume
without repeating successful paid evaluations.

Run the OpenAI benchmark from the project root:

```bash
uv run --extra benchmark python benchmarks/benchmarks_openai.py
```
